OL,3,GNEWSAThree sets of roadworks could
OL,4,Aclose my business
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gift shop owner believes three
OL,7,Fdifferent sets of roadworks have had an
OL,8,Fimpact on her business and she could be
OL,9,Fforced to close.
OL,11,FCharlotte Duncan has run Treat Boutique
OL,12,Fin Debdale Lane, in Keyworth,
OL,13,FNottinghamshire, for nearly 10 years,
OL,14,Fbut a lack of footfall has left her
OL,15,Fworried about its future.
OL,17,FShe said takings had dropped from about
OL,18,F#500 a day to just #20 a day because
OL,19,Fcustomers were having difficulty
OL,20,Faccessing the shop.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
