OL,3,GNEWSAThree sets of roadworks could
OL,4,Aclose my business
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road closure is currently in place
OL,7,Foutside the shop due to emergency sewer
OL,8,Frepairs by Severn Trent, while separate
OL,9,Froadworks are under way on the A52 at
OL,10,Fthe Wheatcroft and Nottingham Knight
OL,11,Fjunctions, both of which provide key
OL,12,Flinks to the village.
